After implementing, the friction (or smoothness) you feel while editing will reveal any remaining weak links. Tell me what you changed and how it behaved.

**7. Explanation & Verification Standard**

**Intuitive**: Interpolation is the easiest way to display dynamic data from your component as text in the HTML. It keeps the template clean and lets Angular handle updates automatically.

**Simple (to a 12-year-old)**: See the kitchen/menu board story.

**Precise**: `{{ expression }}` evaluates the expression in component context at runtime during change detection, stringifies the result, and binds it as textContent. Limited expression syntax, one-way only.

